# Transitive dependencies of the RAG service that cannot be upgraded today.
#
# llm-guard==0.3.16 (presets/ragengine/requirements.txt) is the latest release and
# hard-pins transformers==4.51.3, json-repair==0.44.1 and presidio-anonymizer==2.2.358
# (which itself caps cryptography<44.1). llama-index-llms-huggingface additionally caps
# transformers<5. Pinning the fixed versions therefore makes the image build
# unresolvable. Drop the corresponding entries as soon as an upstream release relaxes
# these pins.

